【例 7】设函数 $u=f(x,y)$ 具有二阶连续偏导数，且满足

$$
4\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x^2}
+12\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x\partial y}
+5\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial y^2}=0,
$$

确定 $a,b$ 的值，使等式在变换 $\xi=x+ay,\eta=x+by$ 下简化为

$$
\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi\partial\eta}=0.
$$

【解】（方法一）变量之间的关系如右图

$$
\begin{array}{ccccc}
&&u&&\\
&\swarrow&&\searrow&\\
\xi&&&&\eta\\
\swarrow&\searrow&&\swarrow&\searrow\\
x&y&&x&y
\end{array}
$$

$$
\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
=\frac{\partial u}{\partial\xi}\cdot1
+\frac{\partial u}{\partial\eta}\cdot1
=\frac{\partial u}{\partial\xi}
+\frac{\partial u}{\partial\eta},
$$

$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x^2}
&=\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi^2}\cdot1
+\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi\partial\eta}\cdot1
+\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta\partial\xi}\cdot1
+\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta^2}\cdot1\\
&=\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi^2}
+2\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi\partial\eta}
+\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta^2},
\end{aligned}
$$

$$
\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
=\frac{\partial u}{\partial\xi}\cdot a
+\frac{\partial u}{\partial\eta}\cdot b
=a\frac{\partial u}{\partial\xi}
+b\frac{\partial u}{\partial\eta},
$$

$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial y^2}
&=a\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi^2}\cdot a
+a\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi\partial\eta}\cdot b
+b\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta\partial\xi}\cdot a
+b\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta^2}\cdot b\\
&=a^2\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi^2}
+2ab\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi\partial\eta}
+b^2\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta^2},
\end{aligned}
$$

$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x\partial y}
&=\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi^2}\cdot a
+\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi\partial\eta}\cdot b
+\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta\partial\xi}\cdot a
+\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta^2}\cdot b\\
&=a\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi^2}
+(a+b)\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi\partial\eta}
+b\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta^2}.
\end{aligned}
$$

将以上三个二阶偏导数代入等式

$$
4\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x^2}
+12\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x\partial y}
+5\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial y^2}=0
$$

得

$$
(5a^2+12a+4)\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi^2}
+[10ab+12(a+b)+8]\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi\partial\eta}
+(5b^2+12b+4)\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta^2}=0.
$$

由题设知

$$
\begin{cases}
5a^2+12a+4=0,\\
5b^2+12b+4=0,
\end{cases}
$$

但 $10ab+12(a+b)+8\ne0$，解得

$$
\begin{cases}
a=-2,\\
b=-\frac25
\end{cases}
\quad\text{或}\quad
\begin{cases}
a=-\frac25,\\
b=-2.
\end{cases}
$$

（方法二）由 $\xi=x+ay,\eta=x+by$ 解得

$$
\begin{cases}
x=\frac{a\eta-b\xi}{a-b},\\[6pt]
y=\frac{\xi-\eta}{a-b}.
\end{cases}
$$

变量关系为

$$
\begin{array}{ccccc}
&&u&&\\
&\swarrow&&\searrow&\\
x&&&&y\\
\swarrow&\searrow&&\swarrow&\searrow\\
\xi&\eta&&\xi&\eta
\end{array}
$$

$$
\frac{\partial u}{\partial\xi}
=-\frac{b}{a-b}\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
+\frac{1}{a-b}\frac{\partial u}{\partial y},
$$

$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\xi\partial\eta}
={}&-\frac{b}{a-b}\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x^2}
   \cdot\frac{a}{a-b}
-\frac{b}{a-b}\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x\partial y}
