&+\frac{1}{a-b}\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial y\partial x}
   \cdot\frac{a}{a-b}
+\frac{1}{a-b}\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial y^2}
   \cdot\frac{-1}{a-b}.
